§§ `ss 18(3), 19(2), 31, 33 -- costs`

#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `a group member who is not a party` `costs of the proceeding generally` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `a group member who is not a party` `costs of the issues common to the subgroup` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `a group member who is not a party` `costs of an issue about one member's claim only` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `a group member permitted to appear on an issue about my own claim` `costs of an issue about one member's claim only` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `a group member permitted to appear on an issue about my own claim` `costs of the proceeding generally` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `a group member permitted to appear on an issue about my own claim` `costs of the issues common to the subgroup` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `a subgroup representative party who is not the representative party` `costs of the issues common to the subgroup` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `a subgroup representative party who is not the representative party` `costs of the proceeding generally` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `a subgroup representative party who is not the representative party` `costs of an issue about one member's claim only` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I be ordered to pay costs?` `the representative party` `costs of the proceeding generally` EQUALS JUST TRUE
