#ASSERT `How much of the damages can go to the representative's costs?` TRUE TRUE 500000 300000 1000000 EQUALS JUST 200000
-- Excess 999,999 just under the damages; 1,000,000 at them; 1,000,001 just over, capped (fork F7).
#ASSERT `How much of the damages can go to the representative's costs?` TRUE TRUE 1299999 300000 1000000 EQUALS JUST 999999
#ASSERT `How much of the damages can go to the representative's costs?` TRUE TRUE 1300000 300000 1000000 EQUALS JUST 1000000
#ASSERT `How much of the damages can go to the representative's costs?` TRUE TRUE 1300001 300000 1000000 EQUALS JUST 1000000
-- No excess.
#ASSERT `How much of the damages can go to the representative's costs?` TRUE TRUE 300000 300000 1000000 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `How much of the damages can go to the representative's costs?` TRUE TRUE 299999 300000 1000000 EQUALS JUST 0
-- s 33(2): no award of damages; no application.
#ASSERT `How much of the damages can go to the representative's costs?` FALSE TRUE 500000 300000 0 EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `How much of the damages can go to the representative's costs?` TRUE FALSE 500000 300000 1000000 EQUALS JUST 0

